===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|hadde|pos=preterite}}, {{m|enm|yhad|pos=past participle}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hæfde|pos=first and third person singular preterite}}, {{m|ang|ġehæfd|pos=past participle}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*habdaz}}, past and past participle stem of {{m|gem-pro|*habjaną||to have}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|have|ed}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|had}}, {{cog|de|hatte}}, {{cog|sv|hade}}, {{cog|is|hafði}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|en|strong form}}
** {{IPA|en|/hæd/|a=RP,GA,CA}}
*** {{audio|en|en-us-had.ogg|a=GA}}
